    <description><![CDATA[<h3>Gatlinburg-Pigeon Forge Airport (GKT)</h3><p>Sevierville, East region<br/>Runway 10-28, Reconstruction<br/>Construction 2028, 30 years at 3%</p><table border="1" cellpadding="4" cellspacing="0"><tr><th>Alternative</th><th>Type</th><th>Initial</th><th>Net present worth</th><th>Closure days</th><th>Section</th></tr><tr><td>Alternative 1</td><td>HMA-New</td><td align="right">$4,285,512</td><td align="right">$6,156,578</td><td align="right">56</td><td>8" P401 on 6" P209 on 6" P154</td></tr><tr><td>Alternative 2</td><td>PCC-New</td><td align="right">$5,918,906</td><td align="right">$6,065,225</td><td align="right">24</td><td>9" P501 on 6" P209 on 6" P154</td></tr><tr><td>Alternative 3</td><td>PCC-New</td><td align="right">$5,681,474</td><td align="right">$5,852,247</td><td align="right">24</td><td>11" P501 on 6" P209</td></tr></table><p><b>Lowest present worth: Alternative 3   |   margin to next: $212,978   |   3% over 30 years   |   lost revenue: Yes</b><br/>Same lowest-cost alternative at 2% (OMB A-94 real rate, FAA PGL 22-01)   |   changes at 7% (pre-2022 AIP rule): see chart 2</p>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#airport</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>-83.528700,35.857760,0</coordinates></Point>
